  "goodToKnow": "Der Aufmarsch is a march, rally or parade, often of a political group (ein Aufmarsch von Rechtsextremen, typically met by Gegendemonstrationen) and a troop build-up: der Truppenaufmarsch an der Grenze. Aufmarschieren means to march up or line up. The neutral word for a protest march is die Demonstration or Demo. Plural: die Aufmärsche."
